# Extra pf rules for the feather jail, spliced in by jail-new -x. The jail is
# created with -n, so these are the only rules it gets.
#
# None of them are feather's. tor is the only thing in the jail allowed out:
# 9001 is the usual ORPort, 443 the port guards use to get through restrictive
# networks, 9030 the DirPort. The wallet reaches the network only through the
# SOCKS port on the jail's own loopback, and loopback needs no rule.
pass in quick on $jail_if proto tcp from $j_feather to any port { 443, 9001, 9030 } keep state
